; A query term that fails to parse as an expression falls back to a pattern
; and leaves no "While parsing value expression" context behind for a later,
; unrelated error.

2024/01/10 Bookshop
    Expenses:Books                $25.00
    Assets:Cash

test reg Books 'x>[zz]' --amount nosuch -> 1
__ERROR__
While handling posting from "$FILE", line 6:
>     Expenses:Books                $25.00
Error: Unknown identifier 'nosuch'
end test
